==Miscellaneous==
*Added 2 new [[Special Abilities|abilities]]: [[Explosion]] (爆波 ''Bakuha'') and [[Immune to Explosions]] (爆涙無効 ''Bakuha Mukō'').
**An Explosion is a three-part blast that expands left and right at a specific range. The initial blast deals 100% of the user's attack power as damage, the two that appear adjacent to the initial blast deal 70%, and the two that appear next to those deal 40%.
*[[Gamatoto Expedition|GAMATOTO]] has a chance to "become Zoned-In" and bring back at least 1 of each item for 3 expeditions. The effect will expire automatically after 24 hours.
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**23,400 grants +5 Rare Catseyes.
**23,500 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
**23,600 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
*Added feature to move from the Evolution screen to [[Catfruit|Catfruit/Behemoth Stone]] stages by tapping the desired material.

==Trivia==
*Version 13.7 added [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]]'s [[True Form]] on September 26th, 2024, exactly 49 months after Idi:N was added ([[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] on August 26th, 2020). This length of time may be a reference to how 49 is the number of sub-chapters in [[Stories of Legend]] and [[Uncanny Legends]].

